      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"6\" type=\"品\">6 最淨地陀羅尼品(四)</cb:mulu>\r\n<milestone n=\"5\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b22\">0422b22</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b23\">0422b23</span><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b24\">0422b24</span><cb:juan n=\"005\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"005\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>金光明最勝王經</title><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422005\">〔卷第五〕－【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422005\">卷第五【大】，〔－〕【西】</span><app n=\"0422005\"><p class=\"lg\">卷第五</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app></cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b25\">0422b25</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b26\">0422b26</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\">大唐三藏沙門義淨奉　制譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b27\">0422b27</span><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"7\" type=\"品\">7 蓮華喻讚品(五)</cb:mulu><head><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422006\">梵. Kamalākara.</span>蓮華喻讚品第七</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b28\">0422b28</span><p>爾時，佛告菩提樹神：「善女天！汝今應知，妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422b29\">0422b29</span>幢夜夢見妙金鼓出大音聲，讚佛功德并懺\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c01\">0422c01</span>悔法，此之因緣我為汝等廣說其事，應當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c02\">0422c02</span>諦聽，善思念之。過去有王名<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422007\">金龍主. Suvarṇabhūjendra.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422007\">金龍主 Suvarṇabhūjendra.</span><cb:tt n=\"0422007\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">金龍主</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Suvarṇabhūjendra.</cb:t></cb:tt>，常以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c03\">0422c03</span>蓮華喻讚稱歎十方三世諸佛。」</p><p>即為大眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c04\">0422c04</span>說其讚曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c05\">0422c05</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「過去未來現在佛，<caesura/>安住十方世界中；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c06\">0422c06</span><p class=\"lg\">我今至誠稽首禮，<caesura/>一心讚歎諸最勝。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c07\">0422c07</span><p class=\"lg\">無上清淨牟尼尊，<caesura/>身光照耀如金色；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c08\">0422c08</span><p class=\"lg\">一切聲中最為上，<caesura/>如大梵響震雷音。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c09\">0422c09</span><p class=\"lg\">髮彩喻若黑蜂王，<caesura/>宛轉旋文紺青色；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c10\">0422c10</span><p class=\"lg\">齒白齊密如珂雪，<caesura/>平正顯現有光明。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c11\">0422c11</span><p class=\"lg\">目淨無垢妙端嚴，<caesura/>猶如廣大青蓮葉；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c12\">0422c12</span><p class=\"lg\">舌相廣長極柔軟，<caesura/>譬如紅蓮出水中。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c13\">0422c13</span><p class=\"lg\">眉間常有白毫光，<caesura/>右旋宛轉<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422008\">頗梨＝玻瓈【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422008\">頗梨【大】，玻瓈【明】</span><app n=\"0422008\"><p class=\"lg\">頗梨</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">玻瓈</rdg></app>色；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c14\">0422c14</span><p class=\"lg\">眉細纖長類初月，<caesura/>其色<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422009\">晃＝光【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422009\">晃【大】，光【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0422009\"><p class=\"lg\">晃</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">光</rdg></app>耀比蜂王。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c15\">0422c15</span><p class=\"lg\">鼻高脩直如金<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422c1501\">鋌【CB】【麗-CB】，鋋【大】</span><app n=\"0422c1501\"><p class=\"lg\">鋌<note type=\"cf1\">K09n0127_p1319a20</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">鋋</rdg></app>，<caesura/>淨妙光潤相無虧；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c16\">0422c16</span><p class=\"lg\">一切世間殊妙香，<caesura/>聞時悉知其所在。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c17\">0422c17</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊最勝身金色，<caesura/>一一毛端相不殊；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c18\">0422c18</span><p class=\"lg\">紺青柔軟右旋文，<caesura/>微妙光彩難為喻。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c19\">0422c19</span><p class=\"lg\">初誕身有妙光明，<caesura/>普照一切十方界；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c20\">0422c20</span><p class=\"lg\">能滅三有眾生苦，<caesura/>令彼悉蒙安隱樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c21\">0422c21</span><p class=\"lg\">地獄傍生鬼道中，<caesura/>阿蘇羅天及人趣；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c22\">0422c22</span><p class=\"lg\">令彼除滅於眾苦，<caesura/>常受自然安隱樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c23\">0422c23</span><p class=\"lg\">身色光明常普照，<caesura/>譬如鎔金妙無比；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c24\">0422c24</span><p class=\"lg\">面貌圓明如滿月，<caesura/>脣色赤好喻<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422010\">頻婆. Bimbha.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422010\">頻婆 Bimbha.</span><cb:tt n=\"0422010\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">頻婆</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Bimbha.</cb:t></cb:tt>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c25\">0422c25</span><p class=\"lg\">行步威儀類師子，<caesura/>身光朗耀同初日；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c26\">0422c26</span><p class=\"lg\">臂肘纖長立過膝，<caesura/>狀等垂下<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422011\">娑羅. Śāla.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422011\">娑羅 Śāla.</span><cb:tt n=\"0422011\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">娑羅</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Śāla.</cb:t></cb:tt>枝。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c27\">0422c27</span><p class=\"lg\">圓光一尋照無邊，<caesura/>赫奕猶如百千日；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c28\">0422c28</span><p class=\"lg\">悉能遍至諸佛剎，<caesura/>隨緣所在覺群迷。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0422c29\">0422c29</span><p class=\"lg\">淨光明網無倫比，<caesura/><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422012\">流耀＝流輝【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0422012\">流耀【大】，流輝【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0422012\"><p class=\"lg\">流耀</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">流輝</rdg></app>遍滿百千界；</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a01\">0423a01</span><p class=\"lg\">普照十方無障礙，<caesura/>一切冥闇悉皆除。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a02\">0423a02</span><p class=\"lg\">善逝慈光能與樂，<caesura/>妙色映徹等金山；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a03\">0423a03</span><p class=\"lg\">流光悉至百千土，<caesura/>眾生遇者皆出離。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a04\">0423a04</span><p class=\"lg\">佛身成就無量福，<caesura/>一切功德共莊嚴；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a05\">0423a05</span><p class=\"lg\">超過三界獨稱尊，<caesura/>世間殊勝無與等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a06\">0423a06</span><p class=\"lg\">所有過去一切佛，<caesura/>數同大地諸微塵；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a07\">0423a07</span><p class=\"lg\">未來現在十方尊，<caesura/>亦如大地微塵眾。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a08\">0423a08</span><p class=\"lg\">我以至誠身語意，<caesura/>稽首歸依三世佛；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a09\">0423a09</span><p class=\"lg\">讚歎無邊功德海，<caesura/>種種香花皆供養。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a10\">0423a10</span><p class=\"lg\">設我口中有千舌，<caesura/>經無量劫讚如來；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a11\">0423a11</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊功德不思議，<caesura/>最勝甚深難可說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a12\">0423a12</span><p class=\"lg\">假令我舌有百千，<caesura/>讚歎一佛一功德；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a13\">0423a13</span><p class=\"lg\">於中少分尚難知，<caesura/>況諸佛德無邊際。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a14\">0423a14</span><p class=\"lg\">假使大地及諸天，<caesura/>乃至有頂為海水；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a15\">0423a15</span><p class=\"lg\">可以毛端滴知數，<caesura/>佛一功德甚難量。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a16\">0423a16</span><p class=\"lg\">我以至誠身語意，<caesura/>禮讚諸佛德無邊；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a17\">0423a17</span><p class=\"lg\">所有勝福果難思，<caesura/>迴施眾生速成佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a18\">0423a18</span><p class=\"lg\">彼王讚歎如來已，<caesura/>倍復深心發弘願；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a19\">0423a19</span><p class=\"lg\">願我當於未來世，<caesura/>生在無量無數劫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a20\">0423a20</span><p class=\"lg\">夢中常見大金鼓，<caesura/>得聞顯說懺悔音；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a21\">0423a21</span><p class=\"lg\">讚佛功德喻蓮華，<caesura/>願證無生成正覺。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a22\">0423a22</span><p class=\"lg\">諸佛出世時一現，<caesura/>於百千劫甚難逢；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a23\">0423a23</span><p class=\"lg\">夜夢常聞妙鼓音，<caesura/>晝則隨應而懺悔。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a24\">0423a24</span><p class=\"lg\">我當圓滿修六度，<caesura/>拔濟眾生出苦海；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a25\">0423a25</span><p class=\"lg\">然後得成無上覺，<caesura/>佛土清淨不思議。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a26\">0423a26</span><p class=\"lg\">以妙金鼓奉如來，<caesura/>并讚諸佛實功德；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a27\">0423a27</span><p class=\"lg\">因斯當見釋迦佛，<caesura/>記我當紹人中尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a28\">0423a28</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423001\">金龍. Kanakendra.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423001\">金龍 Kanakendra.</span><cb:tt n=\"0423001\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">金龍</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Kanakendra.</cb:t></cb:tt><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423002\">金光. Kanakaprābha.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423002\">金光 Kanakaprābha.</span><cb:tt n=\"0423002\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">金光</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Kanakaprābha.</cb:t></cb:tt>是我子，<caesura/>過去曾為善知識；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423a29\">0423a29</span><p class=\"lg\">世世願生於我家，<caesura/>共<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423003\">授＝受【三】【宮】＊【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423003\">授【大】＊，受【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊【西】</span><app n=\"0423003\"><p class=\"lg\">授</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">受</rdg></app>無上菩提記。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b01\">0423b01</span><p class=\"lg\">若有眾生無救護，<caesura/>長夜輪迴受眾苦；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b02\">0423b02</span><p class=\"lg\">我於來世作歸依，<caesura/>令彼常得安隱樂。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b03\">0423b03</span><p class=\"lg\">三有眾苦願除滅，<caesura/>悉得隨心安樂處；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b04\">0423b04</span><p class=\"lg\">於未來世修菩提，<caesura/>皆如過去成佛者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b05\">0423b05</span><p class=\"lg\">願此金光懺悔福，<caesura/>永竭苦海罪消除；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b06\">0423b06</span><p class=\"lg\">業障煩惱悉皆亡，<caesura/>令我速招清淨果。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b07\">0423b07</span><p class=\"lg\">福智大海量無邊，<caesura/>清淨離垢深無底；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b08\">0423b08</span><p class=\"lg\">願我獲斯功德海，<caesura/>速成無上大菩提。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b09\">0423b09</span><p class=\"lg\">以此金光懺悔力，<caesura/>當獲福德淨光明；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b10\">0423b10</span><p class=\"lg\">既得清淨妙光明，<caesura/>常以智光照一切。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b11\">0423b11</span><p class=\"lg\">願我身光等諸佛，<caesura/>福德智慧亦復然；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b12\">0423b12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切世界獨稱尊，<caesura/>威力自在無倫匹。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b13\">0423b13</span><p class=\"lg\">有漏苦海願超越，<caesura/>無為樂海願常遊；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b14\">0423b14</span><p class=\"lg\">現在福海願恒盈，<caesura/>當來智海願圓滿。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b15\">0423b15</span><p class=\"lg\">願我剎土超三界，<caesura/>殊勝功德量無邊；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b16\">0423b16</span><p class=\"lg\">諸有緣者悉同生，<caesura/>皆得速成清淨智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b17\">0423b17</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423004\">梵本缺已下五言三頌</span>妙幢汝當知，<caesura/>國王金龍主；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b18\">0423b18</span><p class=\"lg\">曾發如是願，<caesura/>彼即是汝身。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b19\">0423b19</span><p class=\"lg\">往時有二子，<caesura/>金龍及金光；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b20\">0423b20</span><p class=\"lg\">即銀相銀光，<caesura/>當<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0423003\"><p class=\"lg\">授</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">受</rdg></app>我所記。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b21\">0423b21</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾聞是說，<caesura/>皆發菩提心；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b22\">0423b22</span><p class=\"lg\">願現在未來，<caesura/>常依此懺悔。</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b23\">0423b23</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"8\" type=\"品\">8 金勝陀羅尼品(五)</cb:mulu><head><title>金光明最勝王經</title><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423005\">梵本缺此品但慧沼<g ref=\"#CB00562\"/>舉其梵號. Hiraṇyavatī-dhāraṇī.</span>金勝陀羅尼品第八</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b24\">0423b24</span><p>爾時，世尊復於眾中告<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423006\">善住. Supratisthita.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423006\">善住 Supratisthita.</span><cb:tt n=\"0423006\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">善住</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Supratisthita.</cb:t></cb:tt>菩薩摩訶薩：「善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b25\">0423b25</span>男子！有陀羅尼名曰金勝，若有善男子、善\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b26\">0423b26</span>女人，欲求親見過去、未來、現在諸佛，恭敬供\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b27\">0423b27</span>養者，應當受持此陀羅尼。何以故？此陀羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b28\">0423b28</span>尼乃是過、現、未來諸佛之母。是故當知持此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423b29\">0423b29</span>陀羅尼者，具大福德，已於過去無量佛所\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c01\">0423c01</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423007\">殖＝植【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423007\">殖【大】，植【明】</span><app n=\"0423007\"><p class=\"lg\">殖</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">植</rdg></app>諸善本，今得受持，於戒清淨不毀不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c02\">0423c02</span>缺，無有障礙，決定能入甚深法門。」</p><p>世尊即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c03\">0423c03</span>為說持呪法，先稱諸佛及菩薩名，至心禮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c04\">0423c04</span>敬，然後誦呪。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c05\">0423c05</span><p>「<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423008\">南無＝南謨【三】【宮】【西】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423008\">南無【大】下同，南謨【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】下同</span><app n=\"0423008\"><p class=\"lg\">南無</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">南謨</rdg></app>十方一切諸佛。<anchor xml:id=\"fxT16p0423c01\"/>南無諸大菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c06\">0423c06</span>薩。南謨聲聞緣覺一切賢聖。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c07\">0423c07</span><p>「南謨釋迦牟尼佛。南謨東方不動佛。南謨南方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c08\">0423c08</span>寶幢佛。南謨西方阿彌陀佛。南謨北方天鼓\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c09\">0423c09</span>音王佛。南謨上方廣眾德佛。南謨下方明德\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c10\">0423c10</span>佛。南謨寶藏佛。南謨普光佛。南謨普明佛。南\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c11\">0423c11</span>謨香積王佛。南謨蓮花勝佛。南謨平等見佛。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c12\">0423c12</span>南謨寶髻佛。南謨寶上佛。南謨寶光佛。南謨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c13\">0423c13</span>無垢光明佛。南謨辯才莊嚴思惟佛。南謨淨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c14\">0423c14</span>月光稱相王佛。南謨華嚴光佛。南謨光明王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c15\">0423c15</span>佛。南謨善光無垢稱王佛。南謨觀察無畏自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c16\">0423c16</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423009\">在＝抂【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423009\">在【大】，抂【明】</span><app n=\"0423009\"><p class=\"lg\">在</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">抂</rdg></app><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423010\">〔王〕－【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423010\">王【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0423010\"><p class=\"lg\">王</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>佛。南謨無畏名稱佛。南謨最勝王<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423011\">佛＋（滿謨寶相佛）【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423011\">佛【大】，佛滿謨寶相佛【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0423011\"><p class=\"lg\">佛</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">佛滿謨寶相佛</rdg></app>。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c17\">0423c17</span>南謨觀自在菩薩摩訶薩。南謨地藏菩薩摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c18\">0423c18</span>訶薩。南謨虛空藏菩薩摩訶薩。南謨妙吉祥\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c19\">0423c19</span>菩薩摩訶薩。南謨金剛手菩薩摩訶薩。南謨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c20\">0423c20</span>普賢菩薩摩訶薩。南謨無盡意菩薩摩訶薩。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c21\">0423c21</span>南謨大勢至菩薩摩訶薩。南謨慈氏菩薩摩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c22\">0423c22</span>訶薩。南謨<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423012\">善慧＝善思【明】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423012\">善慧【大】，善思【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0423012\"><p class=\"lg\">善慧</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】 【宮】\">善思</rdg></app>菩薩摩訶薩。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c23\">0423c23</span><p>「陀羅尼曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c24\">0423c24</span><p>「<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423013\">Namo ratna-trayāya tadyathā kunte kunte kuśate kuśale kuśale icchili mitili svāhā.</span><anchor xml:id=\"nkr_note_foreign_0423013\" n=\"0423013\"/>南謨<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423014\">喝<g ref=\"#CB02735\"/>＝曷喇【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423014\">喝<g ref=\"#CB00770\"/>【大】，曷喇【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0423014\"><p class=\"lg\">喝<g ref=\"#CB00770\"/></lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">曷喇</rdg></app>怛娜怛喇夜也　怛姪他　<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423015\">君＝月【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423015\">君【大】，月【宮】</span><app n=\"0423015\"><p class=\"lg\">君</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">月</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c25\">0423c25</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423016\">睇＝<g ref=\"#CB00162\"/>【宋】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0423016\">睇【大】，<g ref=\"#CB00162\"/>【宋】</span><app n=\"0423016\"><p class=\"lg\">睇</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】\"><g ref=\"#CB00162\"/></rdg></app>　君<anchor xml:id=\"fxT16p0423c02\"/>睇　矩折囇　矩折囇　壹窒哩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c26\">0423c26</span>　蜜窒哩　莎訶」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c27\">0423c27</span><p>佛告善住菩薩：「此陀羅尼，是三世佛母，若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c28\">0423c28</span>有善男子、善女人持此呪者，能生無量無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0423c29\">0423c29</span>邊福德之聚，即是供養恭敬、尊重讚歎無\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a01\">0424a01</span>數諸佛，如是諸佛皆與此人授阿耨多羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a02\">0424a02</span>三藐三菩提記。善住！若有人能持此呪者，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a03\">0424a03</span>隨其所欲，衣食財寶、多聞聰慧、無病長壽，獲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a04\">0424a04</span>福甚多，隨所願求，無不遂意。善住！持\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a05\">0424a05</span>是呪者，乃至未證無上菩提，常與金城山\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a06\">0424a06</span>菩薩、慈氏菩薩、大海菩薩、觀自在菩薩、妙吉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a07\">0424a07</span>祥菩薩、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424001\">大氷伽羅. Mahāpiṅgala.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424001\">大氷伽羅 Mahāpiṅgala.</span><cb:tt n=\"0424001\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">大氷伽羅</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Mahāpiṅgala.</cb:t></cb:tt>菩薩等而共居止，為諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a08\">0424a08</span>菩薩之所攝護。善住當知！持此呪時，作如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a09\">0424a09</span>是法，先應誦持滿一萬八遍為前方便。次\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a10\">0424a10</span>於闇室莊嚴道場，黑月一日清淨洗浴，著鮮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a11\">0424a11</span>潔衣，燒香散花，種種供養并諸飲食。入道場\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a12\">0424a12</span>中，先當稱禮如前所說諸佛菩薩，至心<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424002\">殷＝慇【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424002\">殷【大】，慇【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0424002\"><p class=\"lg\">殷</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">慇</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a13\">0424a13</span>重悔先罪已，右膝著地，可誦前呪滿一\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a14\">0424a14</span>千八遍，端坐思惟，念其所願。日未出時，於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a15\">0424a15</span>道場中，食淨黑食，日唯一食，至十五日方\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a16\">0424a16</span>出道場。能令此人福德威力不可思議，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a17\">0424a17</span>所願求無不圓滿，若不遂意，重入道場，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a18\">0424a18</span>既稱心已，常持莫忘。」</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a19\">0424a19</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"9\" type=\"品\">9 重顯空性品(五)</cb:mulu><head><title>金光明最勝王經</title><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424003\">〔重〕－【西】，梵. Śūnyatā.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424003\">重【大】，〔－〕【西】，梵. Śūnyatā.</span><app n=\"0424003\"><p class=\"lg\">重</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424003\">梵. Śūnyatā.</span>顯空性品第九</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a20\">0424a20</span><p>爾時，世尊說此呪已，為欲利益菩薩摩訶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a21\">0424a21</span>薩人天大眾，令得悟解甚深真實第一義\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a22\">0424a22</span>故，重明空性而說頌曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a23\">0424a23</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我已於餘甚深經，<caesura/>廣說真空微妙法；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a24\">0424a24</span><p class=\"lg\">今復於此經王內，<caesura/>略說空法不思議。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a25\">0424a25</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸廣大甚深法，<caesura/>有情無智不能解；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a26\">0424a26</span><p class=\"lg\">故我於斯重敷演，<caesura/>令於空法得開悟。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a27\">0424a27</span><p class=\"lg\">大悲哀愍有情故，<caesura/>以善方便勝因緣；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a28\">0424a28</span><p class=\"lg\">我今於此大眾中，<caesura/>演說令彼明空義。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424a29\">0424a29</span><p class=\"lg\">當知此身如空聚，<caesura/>六賊依止不相知；</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b01\">0424b01</span><p class=\"lg\">六塵諸賊別依根，<caesura/>各不相知亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b02\">0424b02</span><p class=\"lg\">眼根常觀於色處，<caesura/>耳根聽聲不斷絕，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b03\">0424b03</span><p class=\"lg\">鼻根恒嗅於香境，<caesura/>舌根鎮甞於美味，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b04\">0424b04</span><p class=\"lg\">身根受於輕軟觸，<caesura/>意根了法不知厭，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b05\">0424b05</span><p class=\"lg\">此等六根隨事起，<caesura/>各於自境生分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b06\">0424b06</span><p class=\"lg\">識如幻化非真實，<caesura/>依止根處妄貪求；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b07\">0424b07</span><p class=\"lg\">如人奔走空聚中，<caesura/>六識依根亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b08\">0424b08</span><p class=\"lg\">心遍馳求隨處轉，<caesura/>託根緣境了諸事；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b09\">0424b09</span><p class=\"lg\">常愛色聲香味觸，<caesura/>於法尋思無暫停。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b10\">0424b10</span><p class=\"lg\">隨緣遍行於六根，<caesura/>如鳥飛空無障礙；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b11\">0424b11</span><p class=\"lg\">藉此諸根作依處，<caesura/>方能了別於外境。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b12\">0424b12</span><p class=\"lg\">此身無知無作者，<caesura/>體不堅固託緣成；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b13\">0424b13</span><p class=\"lg\">皆從虛妄分別生，<caesura/>譬如機關由業轉。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b14\">0424b14</span><p class=\"lg\">地水火風共成身，<caesura/>隨彼因緣招異果；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b15\">0424b15</span><p class=\"lg\">同在一處相違害，<caesura/>如四毒蛇居一篋。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b16\">0424b16</span><p class=\"lg\">此四大蛇性各異，<caesura/>雖居一處有昇沈；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b17\">0424b17</span><p class=\"lg\">或上或下遍於身，<caesura/>斯等終歸於滅法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b18\">0424b18</span><p class=\"lg\">於此四種毒蛇中，<caesura/>地水二蛇多沈下；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b19\">0424b19</span><p class=\"lg\">風火二蛇性輕舉，<caesura/>由此乖違眾病生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b20\">0424b20</span><p class=\"lg\">心識依止於此身，<caesura/>造作種種善惡業；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b21\">0424b21</span><p class=\"lg\">當往人天三惡趣，<caesura/>隨其業力受身形。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b22\">0424b22</span><p class=\"lg\">遭諸疾病身死後，<caesura/>大小便利悉盈流；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b23\">0424b23</span><p class=\"lg\">膿爛蟲蛆不可樂，<caesura/>棄在屍林如朽木。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b24\">0424b24</span><p class=\"lg\">汝等當觀法如是，<caesura/>云何執有我眾生？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b25\">0424b25</span><p class=\"lg\">一切諸法盡無常，<caesura/>悉從無明緣力起。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b26\">0424b26</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸大種咸虛妄，<caesura/>本非實有體無生；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b27\">0424b27</span><p class=\"lg\">故說大種性皆空，<caesura/>知此浮虛非實有。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b28\">0424b28</span><p class=\"lg\">無明自性本是無，<caesura/>藉眾緣力和合有；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424b29\">0424b29</span><p class=\"lg\">於一切時失正慧，<caesura/>故我說彼為無明。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c01\">0424c01</span><p class=\"lg\">行識為緣有名色，<caesura/>六處及觸受隨生；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c02\">0424c02</span><p class=\"lg\">愛取有緣生老死，<caesura/>憂悲苦惱恒隨逐。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c03\">0424c03</span><p class=\"lg\">眾苦惡業常纏迫，<caesura/>生死輪迴無息時；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c04\">0424c04</span><p class=\"lg\">本來非有體是空，<caesura/>由不如理生分別。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c05\">0424c05</span><p class=\"lg\">我斷一切諸煩惱，<caesura/>常以正智現前行；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c06\">0424c06</span><p class=\"lg\">了五蘊宅悉皆空，<caesura/>求證菩提真實處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c07\">0424c07</span><p class=\"lg\">我開甘露大城門，<caesura/>示現甘露微妙器；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c08\">0424c08</span><p class=\"lg\">既得甘露真實味，<caesura/>常以甘露施群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c09\">0424c09</span><p class=\"lg\">我擊最勝大法鼓，<caesura/>我吹最勝大法螺，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c10\">0424c10</span><p class=\"lg\">我然最勝大明燈，<caesura/>我降最勝大法雨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c11\">0424c11</span><p class=\"lg\">降伏煩惱諸怨結，<caesura/>建立無上大法幢；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c12\">0424c12</span><p class=\"lg\">於生死海濟群迷，<caesura/>我當關閉三惡趣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c13\">0424c13</span><p class=\"lg\">煩惱熾火燒眾生，<caesura/>無有救護無依止；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c14\">0424c14</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424004\">清涼＝清淨【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424004\">清涼【大】，清淨【西】</span><app n=\"0424004\"><p class=\"lg\">清涼</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\">清淨</rdg></app>甘露充足彼，<caesura/>身心熱惱<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424005\">並＝普【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424005\">並【大】，普【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0424005\"><p class=\"lg\">並</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">普</rdg></app>皆除。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c15\">0424c15</span><p class=\"lg\">由是我於無量劫，<caesura/>恭敬供養諸如來；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c16\">0424c16</span><p class=\"lg\">堅持禁戒趣菩提，<caesura/>求證法身安樂處。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c17\">0424c17</span><p class=\"lg\">施他眼耳及手足，<caesura/>妻子僮僕心無悋，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c18\">0424c18</span><p class=\"lg\">財寶七珍莊嚴具，<caesura/>隨來求者咸供給。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c19\">0424c19</span><p class=\"lg\">忍等諸度皆遍修，<caesura/>十地圓滿成正覺；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c20\">0424c20</span><p class=\"lg\">故我得稱一切智，<caesura/>無有眾生度量者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c21\">0424c21</span><p class=\"lg\">假使三千大千界，<caesura/>盡此土地生長物；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c22\">0424c22</span><p class=\"lg\">所有叢林諸樹木，<caesura/>稻麻竹葦及枝條。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c23\">0424c23</span><p class=\"lg\">此等諸物皆伐取，<caesura/>竝悉細末作微塵；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c24\">0424c24</span><p class=\"lg\">隨處積集量難知，<caesura/>乃至充滿虛空界。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c25\">0424c25</span><p class=\"lg\">一切十方諸剎土，<caesura/>所有三千大千界；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c26\">0424c26</span><p class=\"lg\">地土皆悉末為塵，<caesura/>此微塵<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424006\">量＝最【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0424006\">量【大】，最【宮】</span><app n=\"0424006\"><p class=\"lg\">量</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">最</rdg></app>不可數。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c27\">0424c27</span><p class=\"lg\">假使一切眾生智，<caesura/>以此智慧與一人；</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c28\">0424c28</span><p class=\"lg\">如是智者量無邊，<caesura/>容可知彼微塵數。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0424c29\">0424c29</span><p class=\"lg\">牟尼世尊一念智，<caesura/>令彼智人共度量；</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a01\">0425a01</span><p class=\"lg\">於多俱胝劫數中，<caesura/>不能算知其少分。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a02\">0425a02</span><p>時諸大眾聞佛說此甚深空性，有無量眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a03\">0425a03</span>生，悉能了達四大、五蘊體性俱空，六根、六境\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a04\">0425a04</span>妄生繫縛，願捨輪迴，正修出離，深心慶喜，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a05\">0425a05</span>如說奉持。</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a06\">0425a06</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"10\" type=\"品\">10 依空滿願品(五)</cb:mulu><head><title>金光明最勝王經</title><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425001\">梵本缺此品</span>依空滿願品第十</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a07\">0425a07</span><p>爾時，如意寶光耀天女於大眾中，聞說深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a08\">0425a08</span>法，歡喜踊躍，從座而起，偏袒右肩，右膝著\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a09\">0425a09</span>地，合掌恭敬<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425002\">〔而〕－【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425002\">而【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0425002\"><p class=\"lg\">而</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>白佛言：「世尊！<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425003\">惟＝唯【三】【宮】＊【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425003\">惟【大】＊，唯【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊【西】</span><app n=\"0425003\"><p class=\"lg\">惟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">唯</rdg></app>願為說\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a10\">0425a10</span>於甚深理修行之法。」而說頌言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a11\">0425a11</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我問照世界，<caesura/>兩足最勝尊，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a12\">0425a12</span><p class=\"lg\">菩薩正行法，<caesura/><app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0425003\"><p class=\"lg\">惟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">唯</rdg></app>願慈聽許。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a13\">0425a13</span><p class=\"lg\">佛言：「善女天！<caesura/>若有疑惑者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a14\">0425a14</span><p class=\"lg\">隨汝意所問，<caesura/>吾當分別說。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a15\">0425a15</span><p>是時天女請世尊曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a16\">0425a16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「云何諸菩薩，<caesura/>行菩提正行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a17\">0425a17</span><p class=\"lg\">離生死涅槃，<caesura/>饒益自他故？」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a18\">0425a18</span><p>佛告善女天：「依於法界，行菩提法，修平等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a19\">0425a19</span>行。云何依於法界，行菩提法，修平等行？謂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a20\">0425a20</span>於五蘊能現法界，法界即是五蘊，五蘊不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a21\">0425a21</span>可說，非五蘊亦不可說。何以故？若法界是五\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a22\">0425a22</span>蘊，即是斷見；若離五蘊，即是常見；離於二\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a23\">0425a23</span>相，不著二邊，不可見，過所見，無名無相，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a24\">0425a24</span>是則名為說於法界。善女天！云何五蘊能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a25\">0425a25</span>現法界？如是五蘊不從因緣生。何以故？若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a26\">0425a26</span>從因緣生者，為已生故生？為未生故生？若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a27\">0425a27</span>已生生者，何用因緣？若未生生者，不可得\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a28\">0425a28</span>生。何以故？未生諸法即是非有，無名無相，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425a29\">0425a29</span>非校量譬喻之所能及，非是因緣之所生\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b01\">0425b01</span>故。善女天！譬如鼓聲，依木、依皮及桴手\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b02\">0425b02</span>等故得出聲，如是鼓聲過去亦空，未來亦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b03\">0425b03</span>空，現在亦空。何以故？是鼓音聲不從木生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b04\">0425b04</span>不從皮生及桴手生，不於三世生，是則不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b05\">0425b05</span>生。若不可生，則不可滅；若不可滅，無所\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b06\">0425b06</span>從來；若無所從來，亦無所去；若無所去，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b07\">0425b07</span>則非常非斷；若非常非斷，則不一不異。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b08\">0425b08</span>何以故？此若是一，則不異法界。若如是者，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b09\">0425b09</span>凡夫之人應見真諦，得於無上安樂涅槃；\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b10\">0425b10</span>既不如是，故知不一。若言異者，一切諸佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b11\">0425b11</span>菩薩行相即是執著，未得解脫煩惱繫縛，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b12\">0425b12</span>即不證<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425004\">〔於〕－【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425004\">於【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0425004\"><p class=\"lg\">於</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。何以故？\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b13\">0425b13</span>一切聖人於行非行，同真實性，是故不異。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b14\">0425b14</span>故知五蘊非有非無，不從因緣生，非無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b15\">0425b15</span>因緣生，是聖所知，非餘境故，亦非言說之\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b16\">0425b16</span>所能及，無名無相，無因無緣，亦無譬喻，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b17\">0425b17</span>始終寂靜，本來自空。是故五蘊能現法界。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b18\">0425b18</span>善女天！若善男子、善女人欲求阿耨多羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b19\">0425b19</span>三藐三菩提，異真異俗，難可思量，於凡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b20\">0425b20</span>聖境，體非一異，不捨於俗，不離於真，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b21\">0425b21</span>依於法界，行菩提行。」</p><p>爾時，世尊作是語已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b22\">0425b22</span>時善女天踊躍歡喜，即從座起，偏袒右\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b23\">0425b23</span>肩，右膝著地，合掌恭敬，一心頂禮，而白佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b24\">0425b24</span>言：「世尊！如上所說菩提正行，我今當學。」</p><p>是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b25\">0425b25</span>時<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425005\">索訶. Saha.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425005\">索訶 Saha.</span><cb:tt n=\"0425005\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">索訶</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Saha.</cb:t></cb:tt>世界主大梵天王於大眾中，問\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b26\">0425b26</span>如意寶光耀善女天曰：「此菩提行難可修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b27\">0425b27</span>行，汝今云何於菩提行而得自在？」</p><p>爾時，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b28\">0425b28</span>善女天答梵王曰：「大梵王！如佛所說，實是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425b29\">0425b29</span>甚深。一切異生不解其義，是聖境界微妙難\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c01\">0425c01</span>知。若使我今依於此法得安樂住，是實語\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c02\">0425c02</span>者，願令一切五濁惡世無量無數無邊眾生，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c03\">0425c03</span>皆得金色三十二相，非男非女，坐寶蓮\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c04\">0425c04</span>花，受無量樂，雨天妙花，諸天音樂不鼓自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c05\">0425c05</span>鳴，一切供養皆悉具足。」時善女天說是語已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c06\">0425c06</span>一切五濁惡世所有眾生皆悉金色，具大人\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c07\">0425c07</span>相，非男非女，坐寶蓮花，受無量樂，猶如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c08\">0425c08</span>他化自在天宮，無諸惡道，寶樹行列，七寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c09\">0425c09</span>蓮花遍滿世界，又雨七寶上妙天花，作天\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c10\">0425c10</span>伎樂。如意寶光耀善女天即轉女身，作梵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c11\">0425c11</span>天身。</p><p>時大梵王問如意寶光耀菩薩言：「仁\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c12\">0425c12</span>者！<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425006\">（昔）＋如何【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425006\">如何【大】，昔如何【西】</span><app n=\"0425006\"><p class=\"lg\">如何</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\">昔如何</rdg></app>行菩提行？」</p><p>答言：「梵王！若水中月\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c13\">0425c13</span>行菩提行，我亦行菩提行；若夢中行菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c14\">0425c14</span>提行，我亦行菩提行；若<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425007\">陽焰＋（露）【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425007\">陽焰【大】，陽焰露【西】</span><app n=\"0425007\"><p class=\"lg\">陽焰</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\">陽焰露</rdg></app>行菩提行，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c15\">0425c15</span>我亦行菩提行；若谷響行菩提行，我亦行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c16\">0425c16</span>菩提行。」</p><p>時大梵王聞此說已，白菩薩言：\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c17\">0425c17</span>「仁依何義而說此語？」</p><p>答言：「梵王！無有一法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c18\">0425c18</span>是實相者，但由因緣而得成故。」</p><p>梵王言：「若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c19\">0425c19</span>如是者，諸凡夫人皆悉應得阿耨多羅三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c20\">0425c20</span>藐三菩提。」</p><p>答言：「仁以何意而作是說？愚癡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c21\">0425c21</span>人異，智慧人異？菩提異，非菩提異？解脫異，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c22\">0425c22</span>非解脫異？梵王！如是諸法，平等無異。於此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c23\">0425c23</span>法<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425008\">界＝異【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425008\">界【大】，異【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0425008\"><p class=\"lg\">界</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">異</rdg></app>真如，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425009\">〔不一〕－【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0425009\">不一【大】，〔－〕【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0425009\"><p class=\"lg\">不一</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>不異，無有中間而可\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c24\">0425c24</span>執著，無增無減。梵王！譬如幻師及幻弟\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c25\">0425c25</span>子善解幻術，於四衢道，取諸沙土草木葉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c26\">0425c26</span>等，聚在一處作諸幻術，使人覩見象眾、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c27\">0425c27</span>馬眾、車兵等眾，七寶之聚種種倉庫。若有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c28\">0425c28</span>眾生愚癡無智，不能思惟，不知幻本，若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0425c29\">0425c29</span>見若聞，作是思惟：『我所見聞象、馬等眾，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a01\">0426a01</span>此是實有，餘皆虛妄。』於後更不審察思惟。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a02\">0426a02</span>有智之人則不如是，了於幻本，若見若聞，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a03\">0426a03</span>作如是念：『如我所見象、馬等眾，非是真實，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a04\">0426a04</span>唯有幻事，惑人眼目，妄謂象等及諸倉庫，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a05\">0426a05</span>有名無實，如我見聞，不執為實。』後時思\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a06\">0426a06</span>惟，知其虛妄。是故智者了一切法皆無實\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a07\">0426a07</span>體，但隨世俗，如見如聞，表宣其事，思\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a08\">0426a08</span>惟諦理，則不如是，復由假說，顯實義故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a09\">0426a09</span><p>「梵王！愚癡異生，未得出世聖慧之眼，未\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a10\">0426a10</span>知一切諸法真如不可說故。是諸凡愚，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a11\">0426a11</span>若見若聞行非行法，如是思惟，便生執著，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a12\">0426a12</span>謂以為實，於第一義不能了知諸法真\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a13\">0426a13</span>如是不可說。是諸聖人，若見若聞行非行\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a14\">0426a14</span>法，隨其力能不生執著以為實有，了知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a15\">0426a15</span>一切無實行法、無實非行法，但妄思量行非\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a16\">0426a16</span>行相，唯有名字，無有實體。是諸聖人，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a17\">0426a17</span>世俗說，為欲令他知真實義。如是梵王！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a18\">0426a18</span>是諸聖人，以聖智見，了法真如不可說故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a19\">0426a19</span>行非行法亦復如是，令他證知，故說種種\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a20\">0426a20</span>世俗名言。」</p><p>時大梵王問如意寶光耀菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a21\">0426a21</span>言：「有幾眾生能解如是甚深正法？」</p><p>答言：「梵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a22\">0426a22</span>王！有眾幻人心心數法，能解如是甚深正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a23\">0426a23</span>法。」</p><p>梵王曰：「此幻化人，體是非有，此之心數\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a24\">0426a24</span>從何而生？」</p><p>答曰：「若知法界不有不無，如是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a25\">0426a25</span>眾生能解深義。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a26\">0426a26</span><p>爾時，梵王白佛言：「世尊！是如意寶光耀菩薩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a27\">0426a27</span>不可思議，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0426a2701\">通【CB】，迪【大】</span><app n=\"0426a2701\"><p class=\"lg\">通</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">迪</rdg></app>達如是甚深之義。」</p><p>佛言：「如是！\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a28\">0426a28</span>如是！梵王！如汝所言，此如意寶光耀，已教\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426a29\">0426a29</span>汝等發心修學無生忍法。」</p><p>是時大梵天王與\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b01\">0426b01</span>諸梵眾，從座而起，偏袒右肩，合掌恭敬，頂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b02\">0426b02</span>禮如意寶光耀菩薩足，作如是言：「希有！希\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b03\">0426b03</span>有！我等今日幸遇大士，得聞正法。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b04\">0426b04</span><p>爾時，世尊告梵王言：「是如意寶光耀，於未\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b05\">0426b05</span>來世當得作佛，號寶焰吉祥藏如來、應、正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b06\">0426b06</span>遍知、明行圓滿、善逝、世間解、無上士、調御丈夫、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b07\">0426b07</span>天人師、佛、世尊。」</p><p>說是品時，有三千億菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b08\">0426b08</span>薩於阿耨多羅三藐三菩提得不退轉，八\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b09\">0426b09</span>千億天子、無量無數國王臣民遠塵離垢，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b10\">0426b10</span>得法眼淨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b11\">0426b11</span><p>爾時，會中有五十億苾芻，行菩薩行，欲退\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b12\">0426b12</span>菩提心，聞如意寶光耀菩薩說是法時，皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b13\">0426b13</span>得堅固不可思議滿足上願，更復發起菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b14\">0426b14</span>提之心，各自脫衣供養菩薩，重發無上\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b15\">0426b15</span>勝進之心，作如是願：「願令我等功德善根\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b16\">0426b16</span>悉皆不退，迴向阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。」</p><p>「梵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b17\">0426b17</span>王！是諸苾芻，依此功德如說修行，過九十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b18\">0426b18</span>大劫，當得解悟，出離生死。」爾時，世尊即\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b19\">0426b19</span>為授記：「汝諸苾芻過三十阿僧祇劫，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b20\">0426b20</span>得作佛，劫名難勝光王，國名無垢光，同時\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b21\">0426b21</span>皆得阿耨多羅三藐三菩提，皆同一號，名\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b22\">0426b22</span>願莊嚴間飾王，十號具足。</p><p>「梵王！是《金光明》\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b23\">0426b23</span>微妙經典，若正聞持，有大威力。假使有人\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b24\">0426b24</span>於百千大劫，行六波羅蜜無有方便；若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b25\">0426b25</span>有善男子、善女人書寫如是《金光明經》，半\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b26\">0426b26</span>月半月專心讀誦，是功德聚於前功德百分\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b27\">0426b27</span>不及一，乃至算數譬喻所不能及。梵王！是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b28\">0426b28</span>故我今令汝修學，憶念受持，為他廣說。何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426b29\">0426b29</span>以故？我於往昔行菩薩道時，猶如勇士入\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c01\">0426c01</span>於戰陣，不<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0426001\">惜＝昔【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0426001\">惜【大】，昔【明】</span><app n=\"0426001\"><p class=\"lg\">惜</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">昔</rdg></app>身命，流通如是微妙經王，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c02\">0426c02</span>受持讀誦，為他解說。梵王！譬如轉輪聖王，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c03\">0426c03</span>若王在世，七寶不滅，王若命終，所有七寶自\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c04\">0426c04</span>然滅盡。梵王！是《金光明》微妙經王若現在\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c05\">0426c05</span>世，無上法寶悉皆不滅，若無是經，隨處隱\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c06\">0426c06</span>沒。是故應當於此經王，專心聽聞，受持讀\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c07\">0426c07</span>誦，為他解說，勸令書寫，行精進波羅蜜，不\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c08\">0426c08</span>惜身命，不憚疲勞，功德中勝，我諸弟子\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c09\">0426c09</span>應當如是精勤修學。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c10\">0426c10</span><p>爾時，大梵天王與無量梵眾，帝釋、四王及諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c11\">0426c11</span>藥叉，俱從座起，偏袒右肩，右膝著地，合掌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c12\">0426c12</span>恭敬而白佛言：「世尊！我等皆願守護流通\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c13\">0426c13</span>是《金光明》微妙經典，及說法師若有諸難，我\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c14\">0426c14</span>當除遣，令具眾善，色力充足，辯才無礙，身\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c15\">0426c15</span>意泰然，時會聽者皆受安樂。所在國土，若\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c16\">0426c16</span>有飢饉、怨賊、非人為惱害者，我等天眾皆為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c17\">0426c17</span>擁護，使其人民安隱豐樂，無諸枉橫，皆是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c18\">0426c18</span>我等天眾之力。若有供養是經典者，我等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c19\">0426c19</span>亦當恭敬供養，如佛不異。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c20\">0426c20</span><p>爾時，佛告大梵天王及諸梵眾乃至四王諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c21\">0426c21</span>藥叉等：「善哉！善哉！汝等得聞甚深妙法，復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c22\">0426c22</span>能於此微妙經王發心擁護及持經者，當\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c23\">0426c23</span>獲無邊殊勝之福，速成無上正等菩提。」時梵\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c24\">0426c24</span>王等聞佛語已，歡喜頂受。</p></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c25\">0426c25</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"11\" type=\"品\">11 四天王觀察人天品(五)</cb:mulu><head><title>金光明最勝王經</title><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0426002\">梵. Catur-mahārājā.</span>四天王觀察人天品\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c26\">0426c26</span>第十一</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c27\">0426c27</span><p>爾時，多聞天王、持國天王、增長天王、廣目\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c28\">0426c28</span>天王，俱從座起，偏袒右肩，右膝著地，合掌\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0426c29\">0426c29</span>向佛，禮佛足已，白言：「世尊！是《金光明最勝\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a01\">0427a01</span>王經》，一切諸佛常念觀察，一切菩薩之所恭\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a02\">0427a02</span>敬，一切天龍常所供養，及諸天眾常生歡喜，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a03\">0427a03</span>一切護世稱揚讚歎，聲聞、獨覺皆共受持，悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a04\">0427a04</span>能明照諸天宮殿，能與一切眾生殊勝安樂，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a05\">0427a05</span>止息地獄、餓鬼、傍生諸趣苦惱，一切怖畏悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a06\">0427a06</span>能除殄，所有怨敵尋即退散，飢饉惡時<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427001\">能＝皆【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427001\">能【大】，皆【明】</span><app n=\"0427001\"><p class=\"lg\">能</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">皆</rdg></app>令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a07\">0427a07</span>豐稔，疾疫病苦皆令蠲愈，一切災變百千苦\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a08\">0427a08</span>惱咸悉消滅。世尊！是《金光明最勝王經》能\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a09\">0427a09</span>為如是安隱利樂饒益我等，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427002\">惟＝唯【宋】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427002\">惟【大】，唯【宋】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0427002\"><p class=\"lg\">惟</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】 【西】\">唯</rdg></app>願世尊\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a10\">0427a10</span>於大眾中廣為宣說。我等四王并諸眷屬，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a11\">0427a11</span>聞此甘露無上法味，氣力充實，增益威光，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a12\">0427a12</span>精進勇猛，神通倍勝。世尊！我等四王修行正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a13\">0427a13</span>法，常說正法，以法化世，我等令彼天、龍、藥\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a14\">0427a14</span>叉、健闥婆、阿蘇羅、揭路<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427003\">茶＝荼【三】【宮】＊【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427003\">茶【大】＊，荼【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊【西】</span><app n=\"0427003\"><p class=\"lg\">茶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">荼</rdg></app>、俱槃<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0427003\"><p class=\"lg\">茶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">荼</rdg></app>、緊那羅、莫\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a15\">0427a15</span>呼羅伽及諸人王，常以<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427004\">正＝王【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427004\">正【大】，王【明】</span><app n=\"0427004\"><p class=\"lg\">正</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">王</rdg></app>法而化於世，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a16\">0427a16</span>遮去諸惡，所有鬼神吸人精氣無慈悲者，悉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a17\">0427a17</span>令<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427005\">遠＝速【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427005\">遠【大】，速【西】</span><app n=\"0427005\"><p class=\"lg\">遠</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\">速</rdg></app>去。世尊！我等四王與二十八部藥叉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a18\">0427a18</span>大將，并與無量百千藥叉，以淨天眼過於世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a19\">0427a19</span>人，觀察擁護此<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427006\">贍＝瞻【西】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427006\">贍【大】下同，瞻【西】下同</span><app n=\"0427006\"><p class=\"lg\">贍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【西】\">瞻</rdg></app>部洲。世尊！以此因緣，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a20\">0427a20</span>我等諸王，名<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427007\">護世者. Lokapāla.</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427007\">護世者 Lokapāla.</span><cb:tt n=\"0427007\" type=\"app\"><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"zh-Hant\">護世者</cb:t><cb:t resp=\"Taisho\" xml:lang=\"sa\" place=\"foot\">Lokapāla.</cb:t></cb:tt>。又復於此洲中，若有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a21\">0427a21</span>國王被他怨賊常來侵擾，及多飢饉，疾疫流\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a22\">0427a22</span>行，無量百千災厄之事。世尊！我等四王於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a23\">0427a23</span>此《金光明最勝王經》恭敬供養，若有苾芻法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a24\">0427a24</span>師受持讀誦，我等四王共往覺悟，勸請其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a25\">0427a25</span>人。時彼法師由我神通覺悟力故，往彼國\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a26\">0427a26</span>界廣宣流布是《金光明》微妙經典，由經力\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a27\">0427a27</span>故，令彼無量百千衰惱災厄之事悉皆除遣。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a28\">0427a28</span>世尊！若諸人王於其國內，有持是經苾芻\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427a29\">0427a29</span>法師至彼國時，當知此經亦至其國。世尊！\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b01\">0427b01</span>時彼國王應往法師處，聽其所說，聞已歡\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b02\">0427b02</span>喜，於彼法師恭敬供養，深心擁護，令無憂\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b03\">0427b03</span>惱，演說此經利益一切。世尊！以是<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427008\">經＝緣【三】【宮】【西】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427008\">經【大】，緣【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【西】</span><app n=\"0427008\"><p class=\"lg\">經</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【西】\">緣</rdg></app>故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b04\">0427b04</span>我等四王皆共一心護是人王及國人民，令\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b05\">0427b05</span>離災患，常得安隱。世尊！若有苾芻、苾芻尼、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b06\">0427b06</span>鄔波索迦、鄔波斯迦持是經者，時彼人王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b07\">0427b07</span>隨其所須，供給供養，令無乏少，我等四王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b08\">0427b08</span>令彼國主及以國人，悉皆安隱，遠離災患。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b09\">0427b09</span>世尊！若有受持讀誦是經典者，人王於此\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b10\">0427b10</span>供養恭敬，尊重讚歎，我等當令彼王於諸王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b11\">0427b11</span>中，恭敬尊重，最為第一，諸餘國王共所稱\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b12\">0427b12</span>歎。」大眾聞已，<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0427b1201\">歡【CB】，歎【大】</span><app n=\"0427b1201\"><p class=\"lg\">歡</lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">歎</rdg></app>喜受持。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0427b13\">0427b13</span><cb:juan n=\"005\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>金光明最勝王經</title>卷第五</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}